Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:04.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your age is 27?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:06.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have a wife and child?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You like curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:10.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I like ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:13.11,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,CAN PSYCHIC POWERS EXPOSE?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Santa Dodoria sure is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So flamboyantly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way such a young idol\Ncould have a wife and a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:24.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it okay to air that as-is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:31.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nobody would be so pissed off\Nat a local program like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:33.55,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,VACANT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:34.26,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,CARRYING PASSENGERS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're Santa Dodoria, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I saw you on TV the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you really have psychic powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:55.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here's fine. Drop me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:57.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:04.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm trying to insult you\Nor anything. I just wanted you to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna die,\Nhurry on and scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:39.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on now, I thought you brought over\Nyet another scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But this one isn't even human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:45.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh. My grandkid\Nonly brings problems in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:48.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My skin's gonna get dry from all the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:27.41,BD Bottom Left,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(34.333333,335)}EPISODE 3\NIT'S A GRANNY VS. GRANNY CLASH!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:35.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was close! You're super fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But things happened just as I predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:42.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought you'd come around\Nto my blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:46.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You fell into the trap\Nthat I had set up beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:55.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you cross that line, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:57.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a barrier right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When you drive a warding nail\Ninside this circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,the inside of the circle \Nturns into a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:09.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if you drive it outside the circle, the area\Noutside of the circle becomes the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:15.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The reason you couldn't touch me\Nwas because I was protected by a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to eat and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:32.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't think you can keep me trapped forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:36.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't wanna trap you.\NI wanna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, stand your ground, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're gonna cross that line!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When you're in there, you can't make use\Nof your speed that you're so proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You scummy old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:01.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Did an old hag just call\Nanother old hag a scummy old hag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:11.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you burn me,\Nthis guy that I cursed will die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:18.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll kill off all scumbags\Nwho deceive my grandkid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if they're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:23.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:26.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Scummy old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:38.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:42.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, you were home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:46.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up. I'm watching\N"Bakatono."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, I have something\Nto talk about with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You went to a spiritual hotspot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not me, but a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"Why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:04.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because we were talking\Nand that's how things ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"Bakatono"\Nis Japan's national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:11.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, were you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you see a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:16.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He'll be in big trouble\Nif I'm not around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're talking about the evil spirit,\NI killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:24.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,An evil spirit? What kind?\NDid it have glasses on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:30.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't even believe\Nin ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:34.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm a fake spirit medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna hold\Nthat grudge, you scummy old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Something really bad might happen,\Nso just answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop it. Don't believe in those stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:49.80,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are no evil spirits,\Nand I'm a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.18,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:04.11,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:08.15,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So please tell me.\NWhat did you do to the evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Head over to the main shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Scummy old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If something's wrong with Okarun,\NI'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:21.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't want to miss my chance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was just an occult freak\Nwho simply wanted friends.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's my fault.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I forced him\Nto go to that place!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:31.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Okarun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:33.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:40.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought that I'd murdered you\Nor something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:44.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait. Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're still alive and well,\Nscumbag four-eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:53.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I’m sorry I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so irritated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:09.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Since when have you\Nstarted being friends with monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:10.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The curse won't kick in\Nas long as he's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:17.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But one step outside,\Nand he's back to a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:20.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What was that about killing him off?\NYou lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:25.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You seemed pretty desperate.\NYou into brats like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny took his you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:35.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And she told me that as long as she has it,\Nhis curse won't be lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:40.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for what happened to him,\Nso I just want to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. So you do like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:43.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:48.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can use psychic powers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I went to this place where UFOs show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:55.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A lot of stuff happened there,\Nand now I can use powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But UFOs don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:01.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I totally get that reaction.\NI was just like that until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:05.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's true\Nthat I can use psychic powers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:08.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And if I'm not holding back\NOkarun's curse with it, he goes wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure psychic powers exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:13.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know what your criteria\Nfor believing stuff is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, Turbo Granny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:19.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You sure got your hands\Non a troublesome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In the past, she used to be called\NHundred Kilo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:27.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's a modern yokai monster that\Nwreaked havoc all over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:33.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I heard such an elusive entity\Nhad been dwelling for some time in that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I went over there once to check things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:36.88,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KEEP OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was most strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:41.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I couldn't even get near the tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:44.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,because of just how strong\Nthe spiritual power was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You know about location-bound spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:53.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're spirits that stay in particular locations\Nthat they have strong attachments to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're basically the strongest\Nwithin their territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:10:01.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No spirit medium would go up\Nagainst a location-bound spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There was a location-bound spirit\Ninside that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:18.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny and that location-bound spirit\Nhad fused together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't try to fight against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:28.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose my dear grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:35.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not directly involved with it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:37.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:41.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You should return to everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:48.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wonder what the Ken-san I love\Nwould do in times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:51.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When I can't decide, that's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never had regrets by choosing this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:59.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And if this was Ken-san,\NI'm 100% positive he'd go in and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that's what I'm gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:05.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ken-san, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:07.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're totally in love with that kid!\N- No, that's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:09.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:12.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, she's confessing your love to you.\NHow do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:15.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you that's not what I mean!\NI'm talking about the actor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:18.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like I got no choice\Nif you're gonna go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Go play tag with Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:26.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That thing has absolute confidence\Nin its running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:29.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A few random taunts\Nand it's sure to take the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now this is where the problem starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:34.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The location-bound spirit's territory\Nis all of Shono City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:38.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to lure Turbo Granny outside\Nof the city without getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you can drag it away from its territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:44.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,it will get weak and even you guys\Nwill be able to defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:47.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh no, look at these feeble legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:50.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell\NI can play tag against Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:52.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Instead of doing something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,can't you make something\Nlike those barriers and deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:56.40,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY\NWARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:56.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like putting one up at the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't help out to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:03.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:12.71,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KAMIGOE CITY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:08.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My barrier spells only borrow the powers\Nof the gods that live on this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:12.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Once we leave Kamigoe City where we live,\NI can't use these powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:15.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, so we have our own territory, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:18.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All lands have their own gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:21.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The problem is whether you're playing\Na home or an away game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:24.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In any case, this is the only way\Nto defeat Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:26.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you start physically training now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,you should be able to become\Nfast enough to run away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you seriously saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:34.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I tried, I couldn't even\Nmake it to the prefecture finals for track meets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:36.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:36.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:39.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm talking about him.\N- Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:43.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're finally including me\Ninto the conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:44.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:47.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But Okarun, you have no stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:48.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,None at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I have to keep control over your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then he needs to run piggy-backing Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, how much do you weigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, do ya wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's just impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.42,0:13:02.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My limit for going full strength\Nin cursed mode is about twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:06.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then train so that you can\Nalways be at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:10.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get to it. Push-ups, sit-ups, back extensions,\Nand squats. Five sets, 100 reps each.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Huh?\N- Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And Momo, same goes\Nfor your psychic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:17.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You need to power it up\Nmore than what it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:24.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As I can't be of any help,\Nyou guys simply have to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I will be training the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Go to sleep for today.\NWe'll start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Four-eyes, start your physical training\Nright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:34.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:37.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your granny is so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:39.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't she annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:50.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When I fought that big thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:54.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was honestly too desperate\Nto think of anyone other than myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:55.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, there's nothing\Nyou could've done about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:01.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But Miss Ayase, you were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You saved me and defeated the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:11.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if something like that happens again,\NI'll do my best so that I can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So please don't be disappointed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:18.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, don't stop being a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be disappointed.\NYou're overthinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:28.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then why did you slam the door earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:29.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,W-Well, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,See, there you go!\NYou really were disappointed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said I wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:37.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But like, I am right now!\NYou're such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:42.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were pretty awesome\Nwhen you were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:47.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you're kinda dense, Okarun.\NI'll probably be saving you next time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:51.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You sleep there for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll bring you a futon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:15:00.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:07.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,really thirsty,\Nso can I have some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:17.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can I take this barley tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have some shocking news\Nthat just came in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:29.07,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,NEWS FLASH! SHOMA (20) SECRET CHILD SCANDAL\NSHOCKING - POPULAR IDOL SHOMA (20)\NMAY HAVE A SECRET CHILD.\NAGENCY HAS ADMITTED.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:25.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It came out into the open\Nthat popular idol Shoma had a secret child!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:29.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}And his age wasn't 20, but actually 27!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:34.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They need to correct his favorite food\Nfrom ramen to curry, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:35.70,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,NEWS FLASH - SHOMA (20) SECRET CHILD FOUND
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:35.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Furthermore...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:36.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}...he and his partner...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:36.91,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,[LIVE] EMERGENCY SHOMA (20) A SECRET CHILD?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}...have not...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.66,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BROADCAST SHOMA (20)\NSECRET CHILD PRESS CONFERENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:38.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}...formally submitted...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:38.54,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,POPULAR IDOL'S SECRET CHILD FOUND\NSHOMA (20) ADMITS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:39.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}...a marriage license.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:39.54,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,NEWS FLASH! POPULAR IDOL'S SHOCKING TRUTH...\NAGENCY HOLDS EMERGENCY CONFERENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about that news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:49.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! Okarun wants to go\Nto the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:57.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, but this is seriously bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:16:00.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If something blocks my view and\NI can't see Okarun, my spell on him breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:04.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In other words, I have to watch Okarun\Nas he relieves himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:05.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd never want to watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who would show you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That tramples upon someone else's dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you have any good ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:23.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How the hell are you holding\Nthe curse back to begin with, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:24.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:28.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's like I can see an aura around Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:29.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,An aura?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:34.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And when I crush that aura\Nwith my hands, the aura shrinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And the curse subsides, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:41.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Everyone has some kind of aura,\Nand they come in all sorts of colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:43.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see them on the trees\Nand rocks there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:49.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can grab all those auras and move them\Nat my will, though only in a small area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:53.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see. I thought psychic powers\Nwere a lot more omnipotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's quite limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:17:01.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was a lot more amazing the moment\Nthe powers awoke inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:06.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was when everything I imagined\Nturned into reality, like I was invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:11.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But that went away real quick.\NI can only grab auras and stuff now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:13.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, close your eyes for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:16.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way. If I do that, \Nmy spell will be lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:19.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Basically, the problem\Nis the reliance on your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:23.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Try using all of your senses, such as touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:27.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The fact that you can grab the aura\Nmeans that it's tactile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:30.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So close those eyes\Nand try feeling the aura with your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Slowly, feel it around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:44.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:47.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:52.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That really pushed me close to the limit!\NI won't last much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, Momo?\NHe's gonna poop any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me to try that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to be watched\Nas I relieve myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:02.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I wanna pee in my pants even less!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:04.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna borrow your bathro—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:10.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve to take a dump\Nin someone else's house, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:11.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm pretty desperate too, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who said they'd lend you the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:17.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you an absolute idiot?\NI can piss right here if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me in on this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:21.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't think you can run faster\Nthan me in this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Outta my way!\NOr you'll have a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not bad, Ken Takakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:26.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This one is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not letting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I had looked forward to experiences\Nunknown until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,like getting abducted by aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:43.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But this is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:46.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want to hurry up\Nand be released from this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:51.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, you said that you were invincible\Nwhen your powers first awoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:55.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's likely your original power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:58.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And it seems for some reason,\Nthat power has been sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's with that? It sounds kinda cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:06.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to unleash it\Nbit by bit through training,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and we don't know\Nhow long that will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:12.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Though it's okay because it looks like\Nthat boy's physical makeover will take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have to be watched while going\Nto the bathroom for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's my line...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma, it's here! Turbo Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:22.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you! What the hell\Nare you doing to Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:33.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm letting her choose her cause of death.\NA heart attack or a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:37.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My curse is contagious through this brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:41.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Any human this brat sees,\NI can curse to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:47.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.\NI'm not gonna give you any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come to the tunnel tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:55.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll use this brat to curse\Neveryone around there to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:03.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A nosebleed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:07.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're bleeding from your ears, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Does your head hurt or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:13.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo. Let's hear about what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Am I seriously wearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's hard to see in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a bulletproof vest\Nagainst evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.57,0:20:23.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:25.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you let your guard down,\Nyou'll die quite easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:29.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I know that! Despite how we look,\Nwe did defeat aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:33.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as aliens.\NQuit horsing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:39.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You bring all the trouble home in the first place\Nbecause you're like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've never listened to me\Never since you were a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:46.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, so annoying!\NThe old hag's nagging is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:47.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:52.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:54.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What now? You're so naggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:04.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I beg of you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:15.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please, protect those two.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:19.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are we going by train?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:20.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's too far by bicycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And you don't want to use up your stamina\Nbefore we get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:26.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You seriously aren't getting off\Nthe hook, Turbo Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry, this is all for...\N- No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:35.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That hag tried to hurt something dear to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat Turbo Granny into a pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:14.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, Miss Ayase!\NYou shouldn't do that here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:16.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want to hurry up and take these off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it okay to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:21.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a battle uniform to protect yourself\Nfrom evil spirits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:22.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your grandmother said keep it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who the hell would wear something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:29.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fashion is the battle uniform for {\i1}gyarus!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:31.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't get hyped up unless I wear\Nthe clothes I want to wear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:36.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:37.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't this kinda fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:41.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not at all. I feel like I'm about to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:44.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who's a gaudy old hag, ya scummy old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:45.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:47.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny called me\Na gaudy old hag the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:48.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? That really happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:50.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were kinda crazy\Nfrom that curse, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.07,0:23:54.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"Kicking Turbo Granny's Ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.07,0:23:54.37,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 4\NKICKING TURBO GRANNY'S ASS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.58,0:23:56.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But in the end,\Nit's a bit embarrassing to go by train.
